WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:05.760
From live action reinventions of animated&nbsp;
classics to prestige miniseries in the works.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:11.520
Heading into 2023, there’s plenty of fresh,&nbsp;
and anticipated television to look forward to.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:17.940
In October 2022, AMC debuted Interview With&nbsp;
the Vampire, the first of many series that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:22.140
will adapt the novels of author Anne Rice.&nbsp;
The first season premiered to rave reviews,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.740
praising its adaptation of source&nbsp;
material while also updating it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:30.420
for a modern audience by delving into the&nbsp;
novel's queer subtext. Suffice it to say,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.920
the success of Interview with the Vampire&nbsp;
has excited Anne Rice fans leading up to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:40.020
premiere of AMC's next series: an adaptation&nbsp;
of her trilogy Lives of the Mayfair Witches.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:46.320
The series, simply titled Mayfair Witches, is set&nbsp;
to premiere in January 2023. Alexandra Daddario,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:50.400
who received acclaim for her TV appearances&nbsp;
in The White Lotus and True Detective,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:56.100
plays Dr. Rowan Fielding, a woman who discovers&nbsp;
her relation to a long lineage of witches.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.040
"This power goes way back in your family."

00:00:59.245 --> 00:01:01.705
"Do all the Mayfairs have gifts?"

00:01:01.705 --> 00:01:06.480
Daddario co-stars alongside Harry Hamlin,&nbsp;
who plays the current Mayfair patriarch.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.100
After a preview of the series at New York&nbsp;
Comic Con in 2022, Daddario expressed her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:15.300
excitement about the show, as well as the&nbsp;
show's portrayal of real-life witchcraft.

00:01:15.505 --> 00:01:19.045
"And I've always wanted to play a witch.&nbsp;
I feel like I have the complexion for it."

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:23.160
Co-creator and producer Michelle&nbsp;
Ashford described Mayfair Witches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:27.060
as a show about a family, albeit&nbsp;
a dysfunctional one that's hiding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:30.840
a lot of dark secrets. It may have a lot&nbsp;
in common with Interview With the Vampire,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:37.020
so fans of AMC's latest horror installment should&nbsp;
definitely tune in to this spiritual successor.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:44.400
Easily one of the most highly anticipated shows&nbsp;
premiering in 2023 is HBO's adaptation of The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:50.160
Last of Us, a video game originally released in&nbsp;
2013 for PlayStation 3. The game follows Joel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:55.680
a post-apocalyptic survivor who forms an unlikely&nbsp;
partnership with Ellie, a teenage girl who may&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:00.780
possess the cure to the parasitic virus infecting&nbsp;
humans. The series follows the same story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:05.820
with Game of Thrones alumni Pedro Pascal&nbsp;
and Bella Ramsey as the game's dynamic duo.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:09.333
"I think what really impressed them was the&nbsp;
fact that I didn't turn into a monster."

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:15.480
Despite the initial skepticism of the game's&nbsp;
diehard fans, The Last of Us has wowed audiences&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:20.220
with its first looks and trailers, which seem&nbsp;
to be taking the job of adapting a video game&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:25.800
seriously. The cinematography truly resembles&nbsp;
its source material, with Pascal and Ramsey&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:31.260
perfectly embodying the characters as well as the&nbsp;
in-game actors, Troy Baker and Ashley Johnson,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:36.540
did. The other series cast members include&nbsp;
Nick Offerman, Gabriel Luna, and Anna Torv,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:40.260
as well as actors reprising their roles&nbsp;
from the game, such as Merle Dandridge.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:44.940
Given that The Last of Us received a video&nbsp;
game sequel in 2020 – The Last of Us Part&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:50.340
II – this series could last for a while. That&nbsp;
is, if fans of the original game are won over,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:54.292
which is not a guarantee when it comes&nbsp;
to video game adaptations. Perhaps The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.292 --> 00:02:58.766
Last of Us will break that tradition&nbsp;
when it premieres in January 2023.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:03.540
Movie audiences were divided about&nbsp;
Rian Johnson's work, whether it be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:08.700
his Breaking Bad bottle episode about a fly or&nbsp;
his installment in the Star Wars sequel trilogy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:13.020
The Last Jedi. Johnson won audiences&nbsp;
back with his 2019 film Knives Out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:17.340
an Agatha Christie-inspired whodunit&nbsp;
starring Daniel Craig as Benoit Blanc,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:22.140
the world's greatest detective. The film's&nbsp;
success led to a sequel, titled Glass Onion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:27.900
which premiered in 2022, with Craig back as&nbsp;
Blanc, along with a whole new ensemble cast.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.240
"All right. When's the murder mystery start?"

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:35.340
Johnson plans to bring the murder mystery&nbsp;
to the small screen in 2023 with Poker Face,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:39.900
a case-of-the-week series led by Russian&nbsp;
Doll star Natasha Lyonne. The 10-episode&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:43.860
series is set to debut on Peacock&nbsp;
in January. Lyonne plays Charlie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:46.468
a woman with the ability to&nbsp;
tell when people are lying.

00:03:46.468 --> 00:03:52.408
"I only know if something is a lie. The&nbsp;
real trick of it is to figure out why."

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:57.600
Its rotating episode cast will include guest&nbsp;
stars like Adrien Brody, Lil Rel Howery,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:01.920
Stephanie Hsu, Jameela Jamil,&nbsp;
and Nick Nolte, among others.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:06.120
Given the praise Johnson's already&nbsp;
received for his whodunit work,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:11.100
Poker Face is set to impress audiences with&nbsp;
its subversion of the genre. Viewers will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:15.000
get to binge the series' first four episodes&nbsp;
when they all premiere at once on Peacock,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:20.460
then return to follow Charlie's adventures for&nbsp;
the remaining six across the early weeks of 2023.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:27.480
After 11 seasons, The Walking Dead finally&nbsp;
concluded its run in 2022. The show premiered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:32.400
in 2010, becoming one of the most popular&nbsp;
television dramas of the decade. Sadly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:37.020
its viewership waned in its later seasons,&nbsp;
particularly after the departure of longtime&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:41.100
cast members like Danai Gurira,&nbsp;
Andrew Lincoln, and Steven Yuen.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:45.360
But fans of The Walking Dead characters don't&nbsp;
need to worry about saying goodbye. In 2023,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:51.420
AMC plans to debut several spin-off series and&nbsp;
TV movies centered on iconic characters from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:55.740
the franchise. In April, The Walking&nbsp;
Dead: Dead City will premiere on AMC,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.740 --> 00:05:00.300
following the adventures of Jeffrey Dean&nbsp;
Morgan's infamous Negan alongside Lauren&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:03.060
Cohan's Maggie following the&nbsp;
events of the original series.

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:08.520
Later in 2023, two more shows will premiere:&nbsp;
one featuring Norman Reedus' crossbow-wielding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:12.840
Daryl Dixon, the other a mini-series about&nbsp;
departed characters Rick and Michonne,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:17.580
with Andrew Lincoln and Danai Gurira reprising&nbsp;
their roles. While the premiere dates of these two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:23.940
spin-offs are undetermined, Walking Dead fans will&nbsp;
have lots to look forward to in 2023 and beyond.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:30.360
Samuel L. Jackson has been a veteran of the Marvel&nbsp;
Cinematic Universe ever since he made his first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:35.700
appearance as Nick Fury in the post-credits&nbsp;
scene of Iron Man all the way back in 2008.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.640
Since then, he's popped up throughout the movies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:43.697
most prominently in 2012's The&nbsp;
Avengers and in 2019's Captain Marvel.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:47.700
"Excuse me, miss. You know anything about a lady&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.360
blowing a hole through the roof&nbsp;
of that Blockbuster over there?"

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.900
For the first time, Jackson&nbsp;
will star in an MCU project&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:58.020
with the upcoming Disney+ series Secret Invasion.

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:02.640
Based on the comic book arc of the same name,&nbsp;
the series picks up many of the storylines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:06.900
set up by Captain Marvel, surrounding Fury's&nbsp;
relationship to the shape-shifting Skrulls.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:12.420
As Earth faces an invasion from a group of&nbsp;
rebel Skrulls, Fury is the only one who can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:17.100
stop them. He enlists the aid of his right-hand&nbsp;
woman, Maria Hill, played by Cobie Smulders,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:22.020
and the Skrull leader Talos, played by Ben&nbsp;
Mendelsohn. The new cast members joining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:27.240
the MCU in Secret Invasion include Olivia&nbsp;
Colman, Emilia Clarke, and Kingsley Ben-Adir.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.540
During a Comic Con preview, Smulders teased fans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:34.980
claiming that Secret Invasion is a darker&nbsp;
thriller than many other Marvel projects,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:38.820
returning to the tone of previous entries&nbsp;
like Captain America: The Winter Soldier.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:43.740
We know from the comics that the Skrull invasion&nbsp;
has dire consequences for the Marvel universe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:46.860
so we expect this miniseries&nbsp;
to take the Marvel Cinematic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:51.240
Universe to places it's never been,&nbsp;
setting up for the rest of Phase 5.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:56.820
One of the most interesting MCU projects&nbsp;
currently puzzling fans is the solo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.820 --> 00:07:01.560
adventure of Kathryn Hahn's Agatha Harkness.&nbsp;
Agatha made her debut in 2021's WandaVision,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:05.760
complete with a Billboard-charting theme&nbsp;
song. The character played a minor role in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:10.680
the comic books as a mentor to Wanda Maximoff,&nbsp;
as well as a nanny for the Fantastic Four. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:14.280
Agatha will be leading her own&nbsp;
series, Agatha: Coven of Chaos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:21.000
set to debut in late 2023 or early 2024.&nbsp;
Recent casting news has excited fans even more,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:26.700
with newcomers including Aubrey Plaza,&nbsp;
Eric Andre, Sasheer Zamata , and Joe Locke.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:31.860
"So what now? You just&nbsp;
gonna lock me up somewhere?"

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:38.220
It's unclear how Agatha: Coven of Chaos will fit&nbsp;
into Phase 5 of the MCU. Perhaps it will give&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:42.780
fans closure regarding Wanda's fate after the end&nbsp;
of Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:47.160
or maybe it will just be a fun romp with&nbsp;
Hahn doing what she does best. Either way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:51.736
it’ll be interesting to see if it recaptures&nbsp;
the magic the MCU found with WandaVision.

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:59.520
Star Wars fans also have plenty to look forward&nbsp;
to in 2023. 2022 was a fruitful year for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:05.280
franchise, with the debuts of Obi-Wan Kenobi and&nbsp;
Andor. The latter has been praised as one of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:11.160
best shows of the year. In 2023, Star Wars will be&nbsp;
expanding with a third season of The Mandalorian,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:16.260
as well as live-action shows like Skeleton&nbsp;
Crew starring Jude Law and The Acolyte.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:19.800
Longtime Star Wars fans are&nbsp;
especially eager for Ahsoka,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:23.040
a series centered on the fan-favorite&nbsp;
character from Star Wars: The Clone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:27.480
Wars. Rosario Dawson was given the honor of&nbsp;
carrying the character's live-action debut&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:31.800
in season 2 of The Mandalorian, then&nbsp;
reappearing in The Book of Boba Fett.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.480
"I didn't expect to see you here."

00:08:36.205 --> 00:08:37.645
"I'm an old friend of the family."

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:42.000
Dawson's Ahsoka appears alongside many&nbsp;
other characters from the worlds of Clone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.480
Wars and Star Wars Rebels. Sabine&nbsp;
Wren is confirmed to be appearing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:49.020
and there are rumors of Ezra Bridger&nbsp;
making his live-action debut.

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:54.360
Furthermore, Ahsoka promises more of Hayden&nbsp;
Christensen as Anakin Skywalker. For fans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:58.800
of Clone Wars, getting to see Ahsoka and&nbsp;
Anakin share the screen will be quite the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:03.240
spectacle in 2023. Hopefully, Dawson is&nbsp;
able to live up to fans' expectations,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:07.734
but with Dave Filoni as co-creator,&nbsp;
she shouldn't have much to worry about.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:13.620
Sam Levinson has taken the social media world&nbsp;
by storm with his stylish TV series Euphoria,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:17.160
which follows a group of teenagers and&nbsp;
their troubles with drugs, sexuality,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:23.640
and relationships. The show is HBO's standard&nbsp;
fare cranked up to 11. It's resulted in plenty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:28.680
of meme-able moments, as well as a pair of Emmys&nbsp;
for star Zendaya. It's also brought stardom to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:33.300
its ensemble cast, which includes the likes&nbsp;
of Sydney Sweeney and Angus Cloud. Naturally,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:37.680
this makes fans of the series excited to&nbsp;
check out Levinson's next project on HBO.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:43.080
The Idol sees Levinson teaming up with Abel&nbsp;
Tesfaye, known to the public as pop and R&amp;B&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:48.720
singer The Weeknd. In The Idol, Tesfaye&nbsp;
stars as a self-help guru/cult leader who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:53.639
forms a peculiar relationship with Lily-Rose&nbsp;
Depp's character, an up-and-coming pop star.

00:09:53.639 --> 00:09:54.959
"Why don't you just be yourself?"

00:09:55.421 --> 00:09:57.763
"Because there's nothing&nbsp;
about me that's relatable."

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:02.820
The supporting cast includes Troye&nbsp;
Sivan, Dan Levy, and Suzanna Son.

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:07.560
Though little is known about the series&nbsp;
or its premiere date in 2023, viewers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:13.260
can probably anticipate what they're in for given&nbsp;
Sam Levinson's track record. The show will likely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:20.528
be perfect for the social media age, with as many&nbsp;
iconic moments as Euphoria has had in 2022 alone.

00:10:21.134 --> 00:10:25.680
Orphan Black was one of the most critically&nbsp;
acclaimed shows of the 2010s, starring Tatiana&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:31.757
Maslany as Sarah, a woman who discovers she's one&nbsp;
of many clones created via in vitro fertilization.

00:10:31.911 --> 00:10:33.351
"Do you even know who you're talking to?"

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:38.880
The sci-fi series attracted a passionate&nbsp;
and loyal fan base, but eventually came to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:44.760
an end in 2017. Ever since, however, AMC has made&nbsp;
plans to return to the universe of Orphan Black.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:50.460
While Tatiana Maslany is hulking out over&nbsp;
on Disney+, AMC plans to revive Orphan Black&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:56.340
with the spin-off series Orphan Black: Echoes,&nbsp;
set to premiere in 2023. In Maslany's place,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.340 --> 00:11:00.360
the show will star Krysten Ritter, known for&nbsp;
her work in the second season of Breaking Bad,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:04.920
as well as the Netflix MCU series Jessica&nbsp;
Jones. Ritter will appear alongside Keeley&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:09.540
Hawes and Avan Jogia, though who will be the&nbsp;
clone this time around remains to be seen.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.820
Very little is known about Orphan Black:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:16.500
Echoes or its connection to the original AMC&nbsp;
series. However, given how much acclaim and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:21.600
fan support Orphan Black had, Echoes will&nbsp;
find its audience, however big or small.

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:29.220
Speaking of AMC, Bob Odenkirk had an incredibly&nbsp;
acclaimed bow on the network in 2022 with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:34.620
sixth and final season of Better Call Saul. By&nbsp;
the end of the season's 13th episode, Odenkirk had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:40.140
not only proved he's one of TV's greatest dramatic&nbsp;
actors, but his performance also capped off almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:45.660
15 years of television that began in 2008 with&nbsp;
Vince Gilligan's critical darling Breaking Bad.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:52.500
However, Odenkirk is far from done with AMC, as&nbsp;
he'll return to the network in 2023 to star in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:56.820
brand-new series. Straight Man is an adaptation&nbsp;
of Richard Russo's novel of the same name,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.820 --> 00:12:01.440
which centers on the mid-life crisis of an&nbsp;
English professor facing threats to his job,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:05.880
marriage, and reputation. Odenkirk's&nbsp;
co-stars on the series include Diedrich&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:10.140
Bader and Suzanne Cryer, who, like&nbsp;
Odenkirk, have prior experience in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:14.520
television comedy. Straight Man may take the&nbsp;
place of Breaking Bad or Better Call Saul&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:19.320
as an AMC drama with intense stakes&nbsp;
but many brilliant comedic moments.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:23.700
In an interview with Entertainment Weekly about&nbsp;
the new series, Odenkirk confirmed as much,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:28.380
calling the show a blend of drama and comedy&nbsp;
that he predicts will interest fans of Better&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:32.880
Call Saul. At the very least, Straight Man&nbsp;
will be a great new show to tide fans over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:38.100
as they wait for new projects to come from Rhea&nbsp;
Seehorn, Giancarlo Esposito, and Michael Mando.

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:42.480
In the past few years, Elizabeth Olsen&nbsp;
has completely captured the attention&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:46.320
of television audiences. After years&nbsp;
of starring in indie movies between&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:51.540
stints as Wanda Maximoff in the Marvel Cinematic&nbsp;
Universe, Olsen starred in Sorry For Your Loss,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:56.520
a drama exploring a young woman's life following&nbsp;
the sudden death of her husband. Olsen then took&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:56.520 --> 00:13:01.020
her MCU role to Disney+ with WandaVision,&nbsp;
a series that garnered critical acclaim&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:04.980
for its treatment of the story of Wanda&nbsp;
processing a life of trauma and grief.

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:10.020
Love and Death, Olsen's next television project,&nbsp;
will be quite a departure from her previous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:14.880
two performances. The HBO mini-series&nbsp;
will star Olsen as Candy Montgomery,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:20.640
a real-life housewife-turned-axe murderer&nbsp;
in 1980s Texas. There's plenty to be mined&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:25.080
from the story in a TV adaptation, although&nbsp;
it's technically already been done with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:29.400
Jessica Biel-led Hulu series Candy,&nbsp;
which released in 2022. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:34.301
given Olsen's acclaim in recent years, audiences&nbsp;
are excited to see this new take on the story.

00:13:34.301 --> 00:13:36.865
"Would you be interested in having an affair?"

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:41.160
It also helps that Elizabeth Olsen has&nbsp;
quite the supporting cast in Love and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:46.020
Death. Jesse Plemons plays Allan Gore, Candy's&nbsp;
neighbor, with whom she begins the affair that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:49.980
eventually leads to her alleged murder of&nbsp;
his wife. The show also stars Elizabeth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:54.540
Marvel and Krysten Ritter as other figures&nbsp;
in Candy's doomed neighborhood. When Love&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:59.940
and Death finally premieres in 2023, viewers&nbsp;
can expect it to become a future Emmy nominee.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:06.120
In the current age of TV reboots, audiences are&nbsp;
often drawn in by new interpretations of classic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:11.820
properties. This is certainly the case with&nbsp;
the upcoming HBO Max animated series Velma,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:16.935
which finds the glasses-wearing know-it-all of&nbsp;
the Scooby-Doo franchise taking center stage.

00:14:16.935 --> 00:14:22.291
"Unknown caller? Spooky.&nbsp;
Hello? Velma Dinkley speaking."

00:14:22.291 --> 00:14:27.900
The iconic character will be voiced by The Office&nbsp;
alum Mindy Kaling and feature an entirely new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:32.040
design. The rest of Mystery Incorporated&nbsp;
has also received a modernized makeover,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:36.734
as the series follows the gang prior to&nbsp;
their beginnings as a mystery-solving team.

00:14:36.734 --> 00:14:39.176
"What part of the word 'mystery'&nbsp;
didn't you understand?"

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:45.300
It may seem like sacrilege to create a series&nbsp;
in the Scooby-Doo franchise that doesn't feature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:50.580
Scooby-Doo. However, fans may be surprised by&nbsp;
how endearing this new Mystery Inc. team will be,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:55.740
especially with great comedic voice talent behind&nbsp;
them. Shaggy will be voiced by Detroiters star&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:55.740 --> 00:15:00.780
Sam Richardson, while Daphne and Fred will have&nbsp;
the voices of Constance Wu and Glenn Howerton,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:04.380
respectively. The first season's guest&nbsp;
stars include talent like Nicole Byer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.900
Stephen Root, and "Weird Al" Yankovic.

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:11.100
While some diehard Scooby-Doo fans were&nbsp;
initially skeptical of this new series&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:15.720
it has the full support of Scooby-Doo&nbsp;
legends. Matthew Lillard voiced his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:19.800
support for the new cast, which means a&nbsp;
lot coming from him after he expressed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:23.820
disappointment with not being cast&nbsp;
in the 2021 animated film Scoob.

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:30.000
Clone High originally debuted on MTV all the&nbsp;
way back in 2002, as one of the first projects&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:33.900
of writing and directing duo Phil Lord and&nbsp;
Christopher Miller. It takes place in an American&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:38.820
high school populated by clones of various&nbsp;
historical figures, including Abe Lincoln, Joan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:44.400
of Arc, and Cleopatra, with voice actors including&nbsp;
Will Forte, Michael McDonald, and Nicole Sullivan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:50.460
The show aired for one season of 13 episodes&nbsp;
before it was abruptly canceled by MTV following&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:55.020
controversy surrounding their portrayal of&nbsp;
Mahatma Gandhi, which prompted protests in India.

00:15:55.020 --> 00:16:00.060
Despite its short tenure on the air, Clone High&nbsp;
gained a cult following and retrospective acclaim,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:06.060
eventually leading to conversations about a reboot&nbsp;
as early as 2014. Since the series, Phil Lord and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:10.080
Christopher Miller have gone on to more success in&nbsp;
the animation world, with films like Spider-Man:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:15.000
Into the Spider-Verse, The Lego Movie, and&nbsp;
Cloudy With a Chance of Meatballs. Finally,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:20.580
after almost 10 years, two seasons of a revival&nbsp;
series of Clone High were picked up at HBO Max.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:25.500
Christopher Miller confirmed via Twitter that&nbsp;
the reboot would premiere sometime in 2023,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:30.240
though an official release date hasn't been&nbsp;
confirmed. Gandhi will likely be absent from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:35.040
this reboot, but fans of the show can probably&nbsp;
live with this change. It's even possible the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:38.880
show will feature an entirely new cast&nbsp;
of historical clones and voice actors.

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:45.720
Speaking of reboots, there's plenty of interest in&nbsp;
Netflix's upcoming live-action reboot of Avatar:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:50.040
The Last Airbender. The original animated&nbsp;
series premiered on Nickelodeon in 2005,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:55.560
running for three seasons and spawning a spin-off&nbsp;
with the highly successful The Legend of Korra.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:59.580
The series takes place in a world where&nbsp;
people can control one of four elements:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:04.380
earth, air, fire, and water. Aang,&nbsp;
the series' bald-headed protagonist,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:09.300
is the only remaining Airbender in the world.&nbsp;
He's hunted by the vengeful Fire Nation.

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:14.220
Given the fact that Avatar: The Last Airbender is&nbsp;
regarded by many as one of the greatest animated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:19.860
series of all time, a Netflix reboot is subject&nbsp;
to lots of scrutiny — especially on the heels of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:24.360
the last live-action adaptation of the series,&nbsp;
a film directed by M. Night Shyamalan that was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:28.920
universally panned. Fans were even more&nbsp;
concerned about Netflix's series when the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:33.420
original creators of the Nickelodeon series,&nbsp;
Michael Dante DiMartino and Bryan Konietzko,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:36.540
left the project due to creative&nbsp;
differences with the streaming service.

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:41.580
Nevertheless, Avatar: The Last Airbender has&nbsp;
also shown promise for diehard fans of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:47.280
franchise. It features a diverse cast from Asian&nbsp;
and Native-American communities, which Shyamalan's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:51.540
film notably lacked. Little is known about what&nbsp;
will be different in its version of the series,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:56.700
but casting rumors have suggested that Aang&nbsp;
may not be the only Avatar in this iteration.

